So you are ready then.

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:51.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sick of it.
I'm so sick of it.

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:53.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Have you ever thought
about retiring?

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because my mother-in-law,
before I even met her, retired

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:01.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just woke up one day and said,
"I'm not doing it anymore.

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:03.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We'd starve.
-Yeah.

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:10.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's no takeout, really,
to speak of, so...

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.138 size:75% position:38% line:92%
We don't eat rabbit.

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:15.008 size:84% position:42%
We have tons of rabbit.
We don't eat rabbit.

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:15.975 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:19.145 line:92%
-The chipmunks ate my tomatoes

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.113 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
We'd starve.

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:23.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah. Alright.
Well, that's good to know.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:26.352
Your new show, "United We Fall,"
you play someone

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:28.621
who moves in with her son
and her grandchildren.

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:33.093
I mean, based on the way you'r
singing your praises as a chef

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:36.162
it seems like they would be very
happy if you moved in with them.

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:37.831 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yes? In real life.

00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:42.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, in real life,
my daughter and her family

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:44.938 size:78% position:39%
I think, would really
like me to move in.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:47.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think that we'd all
have a good time.

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.809
I think that they'd like
my husband to move in, too

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:52.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think we'd all like
to live together.

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:54.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's sort of a --
We like each other.

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:59.385
