00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:02.889
How did you get along with
the children in your cast?

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:05.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I've always liked
working with kids.

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
I like kids a lot.
-Really?

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:08.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
Yeah, I like them.

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:11.331
I like working with kids.
I like working with dogs.

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:12.899 line:92%
I love working with monkeys.

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:14.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
I really like
working with monkeys.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:20.073
-Really? Monkeys is -- The few
times we had monkeys on the se

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:22.342 line:92%
at "SNL," I was very uneasy.

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:23.910 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But you enjoy it?

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.212 line:92%
-Yeah, I find them fascinating

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
I worked with
a 2-year-old chimp once,

00:02:28.448 --> 00:02:32.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
