00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:43.062 line:92%
It was so interesting to watch

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:46.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
We had a spider monkey
on "3rd Rock,"

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:50.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
