"So, you like monkeys?"

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:57.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said,
"Yeah, I like all animals.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:00.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said, "Have you ever me
an orangutan?"

00:03:00.313 --> 00:03:02.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "No," and he said,
"Do you want to?"

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:05.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I went, "Yeah."
And he said, "Come with me."

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:08.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we went out to the traile
that the animals came in.

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:09.956 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And he said, "Go on in."

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:12.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I walked in,
and there's an orangutan

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:15.028 align:start size:94% position:6%
sitting on a sofa
kind of like...

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:15.828 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:17.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And the guy said,
"Go on, sit next to him."

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:21.568
And I sort of went over
and I sat next to the orangutan.

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:24.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the orangutan
looked at me and went...

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:28.441 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughing ]

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:30.510 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It just hugged me.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:31.044 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wow.

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:34.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was just --
He just hugged me.

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:38.284
-That's as good an ending
you can hope for in a stor

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:39.919 size:78% position:39%
where a guy tells you
to get into a truck

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:43.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
with a weird monkey.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:46.793
A lot of times
there's no orangutan in the van.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:47.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's just --
-Oh, stop.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.329
-That's when you realized
you've made a mistake.

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:52.165
I tell you, they go, "Go i
and look at the orangutan.

00:03:52.165 --> 00:03:53.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
The next thing you know,
the van door closes.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:54.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's the last
anybody ever sees of you.

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:57.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, no, no, that's only
if it's a white panel truck.

00:03:57.637 --> 00:04:00.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're right. I'm sorry.
I've been misleading.

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:01.407 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes. Yeah.

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:06.346
-The last time we saw each other
was a really fun,

00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:08.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
emotional night
because we were --

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:09.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was the "SNL 40th."
-Yeah.

00:04:09.449 --> 00:04:11.517 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And we were at
the "Update" desk together

00:04:11.517 --> 00:04:13.920
-Yeah.
-Everybody went back that night,

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:17.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
had to work through some stuff
to be back in 8H.

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:20.893 size:78% position:39% line:92%
How was that for you?

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:25.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I had gone to a couple of
the rehearsals and --

00:04:25.298 --> 00:04:27.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I like to get
a sense of place.

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:29.902
So I would go to the rehearsal
early and just sort of sit u

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:32.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the bleachers and get a fee
for what it was like

00:04:32.472 --> 00:04:35.174 size:81% position:41%
and what was going on
and what the vibe was.

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:37.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
And people would come up t
talk to me, which is --

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:40.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
