which was just great.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:41.547 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Just so friendly.

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:45.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I got a feel for it
It wasn't so scary.

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:48.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
The scary part of 8H
was getting out.

00:04:48.821 --> 00:04:49.856 line:92%
