00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:24.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it was never quite
what it was...

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was new.
-...when it first started.

00:05:26.092 --> 00:05:29.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because, I mean, that -- like,
people banging on the car,

00:05:29.062 --> 00:05:31.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
like what you're talking about
I think, is very unique

00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:34.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
to that first cast
and the sort of institutio

00:05:34.901 --> 00:05:38.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
that "SNL" was to New York
at the time.

00:05:38.204 --> 00:05:39.105 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, yeah.

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:41.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, we were --
we were a phenomenon.

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:44.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
