and counterculture.

00:05:48.047 --> 00:05:50.049 line:92%
And television was changing.

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:53.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, just look at the way
we looked was different.

00:05:53.286 --> 00:05:56.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
You didn't see people like tha
